WEBVTT

00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:03.010
Want to know what a potential multibagger looks like?

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:05.510
Sorry, we don't sell fake hopes,

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:07.210
we teach you the truth.

00:00:07.500 --> 00:00:12.290
₹903 to ₹680 in 5 trading days.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:13.810
The night before the fall,

00:00:13.980 --> 00:00:15.450
the board made a U-turn.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:17.550
10 October, शनिवार।

00:00:17.660 --> 00:00:20.520
दोपहर ₹467 crore का order।

00:00:21.020 --> 00:00:22.450
रात पौने 11 बजे,

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:25.510
warrants से पैसा जुटाने के लिए board meeting का notice।

00:00:25.780 --> 00:00:27.350
15 October की शाम,

00:00:27.340 --> 00:00:28.950
board ने plan छोड़ दिया।

00:00:28.800 --> 00:00:31.710
अगले दिन stock 12% गिरा।

00:00:31.700 --> 00:00:32.990
Viviana Power Tech,

00:00:33.020 --> 00:00:37.490
Vadodara। Gujarat की बिजली कंपनियों के लिए substations और lines।

00:00:37.700 --> 00:00:41.850
चार साल में revenue ₹33 से ₹531 crore

00:00:42.060 --> 00:00:43.450
पर cash नहीं आया।

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:46.070
तीन साल से operating cash flow negative।

00:00:46.360 --> 00:00:49.290
बिल का पैसा औसतन 267 दिन में।

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.690
और borrowings एक साल में double,

00:00:51.800 --> 00:00:53.030
₹100 crore

00:00:53.240 --> 00:00:55.410
वो ₹467 crore का order?

00:00:55.640 --> 00:00:58.690
Company के मुताबिक़ पहले ही बताया जा चुका था।

00:00:58.700 --> 00:01:01.610
Company कहती है कोई client late नहीं।

00:01:01.480 --> 00:01:04.130
July में ₹40 crore वसूल हुए।

00:01:04.200 --> 00:01:06.710
Q2 results are due by November 14.

00:01:06.920 --> 00:01:09.270
Watch whether the cash finally shows up.

00:01:09.400 --> 00:01:10.630
This is AVRON.

